WEBVTT

01:43.760 --> 01:47.800
PRINCE HEIR'S MANSION

01:48.440 --> 01:50.640
Looking back on the day
we bowed to the Sun and Moon…

01:50.720 --> 01:51.560
DEED OF DIVORCE

01:51.640 --> 01:54.240
…we joined hands as a divine couple.

01:54.320 --> 01:57.600
But the red thread was mistakenly tied,

01:57.680 --> 01:59.840
and names were wrongly engraved
on the Three Lives Stone.

01:59.920 --> 02:02.680
Though the divine light remains,

02:02.760 --> 02:05.000
our marital bond has dissolved.

02:05.640 --> 02:08.960
Now, may you reapply your makeup,

02:09.039 --> 02:10.600
wear your golden hairpins,

02:10.680 --> 02:13.400
and enjoy spring as you form a new union.

02:25.040 --> 02:26.480
Is there news from the High Priest?

02:27.320 --> 02:28.440
Rest assured, Your Highness.

02:28.520 --> 02:30.520
The High Priest has gone to see the King,

02:30.600 --> 02:31.880
and news will come soon.

02:33.240 --> 02:34.560
Forgive me for prying,

02:35.560 --> 02:38.880
but you haven't rested since your return

02:38.960 --> 02:41.000
and are already handling the divorce.

02:42.920 --> 02:45.480
Once my father agrees to the divorce,

02:45.560 --> 02:48.040
Mei Lin will be free.

02:48.800 --> 02:50.440
I don't understand.

02:50.520 --> 02:52.320
You love the Princess Heir.

02:53.080 --> 02:54.760
Why divorce her?

02:57.760 --> 03:00.760
The Snow Dragon Whisker
is a heavenly chance,

03:01.880 --> 03:04.360
and she has let go of the past.

03:04.960 --> 03:06.320
The flower will soon bloom.

03:07.000 --> 03:08.360
After she is cured,

03:09.160 --> 03:10.280
if I were

03:10.360 --> 03:13.240
to fabricate other reasons
to force her to stay in the palace,

03:14.680 --> 03:17.080
that would be taking advantage
of her gratitude.

03:17.160 --> 03:18.400
What about your feelings?

03:18.480 --> 03:20.920
Shouldn't you at least
tell the Princess Heir?

03:33.760 --> 03:36.080
If she still bears the responsibility
of being Princess Heir,

03:36.160 --> 03:38.560
confessing will burden her.

03:39.520 --> 03:42.920
Only after the divorce
can she truly be Mei Lin,

03:43.720 --> 03:47.480
free to choose her own path,
staying or leaving.

03:48.360 --> 03:52.040
Given all you've done,
in my humble opinion,

03:52.640 --> 03:54.680
it may not be the right time for divorce,

03:55.280 --> 03:57.240
especially since she just
let go of Prince Jing.

03:58.080 --> 04:01.920
It might be better
for Miss Mei Lin to stay longer,

04:02.000 --> 04:04.840
increasing your chances.

04:07.800 --> 04:10.120
I am not competing with Prince Jing.

04:11.720 --> 04:12.720
I want to win Mei Lin's heart.

04:16.839 --> 04:17.680
Your Highness.

04:19.120 --> 04:20.240
How is it?

04:21.120 --> 04:23.600
Congratulations, Your Highness.
The King has agreed to the divorce.

04:24.560 --> 04:26.160
I informed the King

04:26.240 --> 04:29.320
that the Moon Kunlun goddess's power
had left Mei Lin,

04:29.400 --> 04:31.040
and the King wasn't suspicious.

04:36.120 --> 04:37.040
General,

04:37.600 --> 04:40.000
the King has agreed
to the Sun Kunlun's divorce.

04:46.040 --> 04:50.440
It seems the gods support me this time.

05:01.360 --> 05:02.280
Tong Zhihui.

05:02.360 --> 05:04.400
Tong Zhihui reports to the patrol camp.

05:04.480 --> 05:05.360
Pan Xinlin.

05:05.440 --> 05:07.640
Pan Xinlin reports to the patrol camp.

05:08.800 --> 05:12.280
We revitalized Qingzhou's commerce
and won back the people's hearts.

05:12.360 --> 05:14.520
My lord, Qingzhou has truly revived.

05:16.320 --> 05:18.160
It's not easy to revive a city.

05:18.840 --> 05:21.360
There is a lot more we need to do.

05:23.120 --> 05:27.640
Once the border trade
and defenses are settled,

05:28.200 --> 05:30.880
His Majesty may urge you
to return to Zhaojing.

05:30.960 --> 05:33.680
The reconstruction of Qingzhou
has just begun to show progress.

05:34.280 --> 05:38.120
Frequent official changes
would destabilize the people.

05:40.400 --> 05:41.680
My Father will understand.

05:42.880 --> 05:43.720
Mei Lin.

05:46.600 --> 05:48.760
Mei Lin reports to the patrol camp.

05:49.640 --> 05:50.720
Forward march!

06:05.440 --> 06:08.760
The Snow Dragon Whisker
should be blooming soon.

06:10.200 --> 06:14.120
Have the wandering healer
check Mei Lin's pulse

06:14.840 --> 06:17.160
and ensure the poison is gone.

06:18.600 --> 06:19.640
Yes.

06:26.360 --> 06:33.320
DEED OF DIVORCE

06:44.320 --> 06:45.800
The Deed of Divorce is here.

06:45.880 --> 06:48.800
Now you are no longer the Princess Heir

06:48.880 --> 06:50.520
but Miss Mei Lin.

06:51.640 --> 06:52.800
This jade ring…

06:54.160 --> 06:57.920
Do you know in Xiyan,
a jade ring is used to confess…?

06:59.040 --> 07:02.000
No, I mean this… The Deed of Divorce is…

07:03.120 --> 07:04.720
This jade ring is…

07:04.800 --> 07:07.320
Anyway, I mean…

07:48.640 --> 07:49.480
Mei Lin,

07:50.800 --> 07:53.880
ten years ago,
I met you in the Qingzhou mine.

07:55.320 --> 07:58.520
Your image has stayed with me since.

08:00.280 --> 08:02.720
Actually, I…

08:20.160 --> 08:22.600
Your Highness, Mei has fainted.
The poison is acting up,

08:22.680 --> 08:25.000
and the Snow Dragon Whisker
has been taken by Mingju.

08:36.120 --> 08:37.400
Your Majesty, please.

09:05.440 --> 09:09.040
Is this the Snow Dragon Whisker?

09:09.960 --> 09:10.800
Yes.

09:11.640 --> 09:14.640
It is a holy plant
from the Sacred Mountain.

09:14.720 --> 09:17.560
Just smelling it can make
one's mind wander.

09:18.520 --> 09:22.000
If it's eaten, it will make one immortal.

09:26.240 --> 09:27.080
You can't.

09:33.040 --> 09:35.320
Father, the Snow Dragon Whisker
can't be eaten raw.

09:35.400 --> 09:37.200
You are preventing His Majesty
from achieving immortality.

09:37.280 --> 09:39.480
Do you want to rebel?

09:39.560 --> 09:40.640
Arrest him.

09:46.360 --> 09:48.440
Father, please understand
that the Snow Dragon Whisker

09:48.520 --> 09:50.240
must be combined with special herbs,

09:50.320 --> 09:52.640
prepared, and then consumed
to grant longevity.

09:53.680 --> 09:56.560
Knowing that His Majesty is searching
everywhere for the herb,

09:56.640 --> 10:00.240
you tried to hide the whereabouts
of the Snow Dragon Whisker.

10:00.320 --> 10:02.240
What is your intention?

10:05.800 --> 10:06.760
Father,

10:07.800 --> 10:11.200
the Snow Dragon Whisker
was found by me for you.

10:30.320 --> 10:33.200
You concealed it first,

10:34.560 --> 10:38.560
and now you say you want
to present it to me.

10:40.560 --> 10:43.920
I did conceal the Snow Dragon Whisker
for a personal reason.

10:44.760 --> 10:48.400
I knew I had found the wrong Moon Kunlun,

10:49.840 --> 10:51.840
and felt guilty towards you.

10:51.920 --> 10:53.880
I wanted to present it to you

10:53.960 --> 10:56.520
after it is prepared to make you happy.

10:57.240 --> 11:00.160
Apart from that,
I have no other intentions.

11:15.920 --> 11:17.240
Please calm your anger, Your Majesty.

11:20.720 --> 11:24.480
Your Majesty, the Snow Dragon Whisker
becomes edible after it blooms.

11:24.560 --> 11:26.000
After I interpreted the celestial signs,

11:26.080 --> 11:27.440
I told His Highness

11:27.520 --> 11:28.520
that the Snow Dragon Whisker

11:28.600 --> 11:30.240
need to be prepared with a special herb.

11:30.320 --> 11:32.960
The special herb is the Sun Kunlun.

11:33.680 --> 11:35.120
It must be personally prepared

11:35.200 --> 11:36.920
by the Sun Kunlun during peak Yang energy

11:37.000 --> 11:39.520
for the divine herb to grant longevity.

11:40.600 --> 11:43.400
Father, I'm willing to endure
49 trials by heaven

11:43.480 --> 11:44.920
to prove my innocence.

11:46.160 --> 11:47.520
If I succeed,

11:47.600 --> 11:50.160
it will prove my loyalty to you.

11:50.240 --> 11:53.080
At that time, I will present
the Snow Dragon Whisker to you personally.

12:11.360 --> 12:12.600
Begin the execution.

12:57.080 --> 12:58.040
There is a divine revelation.

12:58.800 --> 12:59.720
The deities are angry.

12:59.800 --> 13:01.320
Could the Prince Heir be innocent?

13:04.600 --> 13:08.560
- Please, gods, calm your anger.
- Please, gods, calm your anger.

13:18.560 --> 13:19.600
Father,

13:21.240 --> 13:23.600
my loyalty has been proved.

13:24.520 --> 13:28.560
Please return the Snow Dragon Whisker
to me first.

13:47.640 --> 13:48.600
Your Majesty,

13:48.680 --> 13:51.200
the High Priest died.

13:59.960 --> 14:01.000
Your Majesty,

14:01.080 --> 14:04.520
historical records mention
a High Priest punished by heaven

14:04.600 --> 14:06.360
for deceiving the King,

14:06.440 --> 14:09.440
leading to sudden death on the spot.

14:10.040 --> 14:11.240
The celestial signs indicated

14:11.920 --> 14:13.480
that the High Priest angered the gods.

14:14.400 --> 14:17.960
The High Priest's death
was a warning from the gods.

14:19.560 --> 14:22.200
Please, gods, calm your anger.

14:22.280 --> 14:25.520
Please, gods, calm your anger.

14:25.600 --> 14:28.920
Please, gods, calm your anger.

14:29.840 --> 14:31.960
The High Priest was murdered.

14:32.040 --> 14:33.440
Please, Father, see this clearly.

14:33.520 --> 14:34.960
Murdered?

14:35.040 --> 14:37.320
All the subjects present

14:37.400 --> 14:40.640
saw heaven punish the High Priest
on behalf of the King.

14:41.360 --> 14:44.240
Now, you defend the High Priest…

14:44.920 --> 14:48.600
Were you colluding with the High Priest

14:48.680 --> 14:50.560
to deceive your Father?

14:50.640 --> 14:51.600
Father.

14:51.680 --> 14:52.760
Alright.

14:54.600 --> 14:56.320
Considering that you

14:56.400 --> 14:59.600
endured the trials by heaven,

15:00.880 --> 15:03.240
I won't strip you of your title.

15:04.160 --> 15:05.720
I have attained longevity,

15:05.800 --> 15:08.200
with herbs available for preparation.

15:09.040 --> 15:13.000
The Snow Dragon Whisker
is mine in the first place.

15:13.960 --> 15:16.680
Why can't I eat it raw?

15:17.280 --> 15:18.320
Father, you can't.

15:18.920 --> 15:22.280
If you continue with rebellious thoughts,

15:22.360 --> 15:24.680
this will be your fate.

15:26.320 --> 15:27.720
No, Father!

15:27.800 --> 15:29.080
You can't.

15:31.600 --> 15:33.080
You can't.

16:04.880 --> 16:09.400
NOT TOO LATE

16:12.000 --> 16:14.440
The Princess Heir's pulse
is weak and floating,

16:14.520 --> 16:15.640
indicating poisoning.

16:16.240 --> 16:18.560
The sudden onset of the Momai poison

16:18.640 --> 16:20.560
suggests she has been overworked

16:20.640 --> 16:22.000
in Qingzhou or recently fell ill.

16:22.080 --> 16:26.720
If untreated, it will destroy her organs.

16:32.080 --> 16:34.640
Your Highness, now the antidote is lost.

16:34.720 --> 16:35.680
What should we do about Mei?

16:39.720 --> 16:41.240
There must be a way.

16:50.240 --> 16:53.360
NOT TOO LATE

16:58.120 --> 16:59.160
Your Highness.

16:59.920 --> 17:01.080
Your Highness,

17:01.160 --> 17:02.400
the Great Shaman might have a solution.

17:03.200 --> 17:05.000
I know the dark arts of blood.

17:05.079 --> 17:07.960
We need compatible blood
for a transfusion,

17:08.040 --> 17:09.520
but it's dangerous.

17:20.160 --> 17:21.200
My lord.

17:22.920 --> 17:24.200
Any news from the physician?

17:24.280 --> 17:27.359
Does Mei Lin still sweat
or lose her appetite frequently?

17:27.440 --> 17:29.160
- How many hours does she sleep?
- My lord,

17:29.760 --> 17:32.160
the physician has just arrived in Xiyan.
No news yet.

17:35.160 --> 17:36.240
No.

17:36.320 --> 17:38.840
Send a visiting card to Xiyan Palace.

17:38.920 --> 17:41.040
I won't be relieved
until I see Mei Lin well.

17:41.760 --> 17:42.720
Yes.

17:49.880 --> 17:53.800
PRINCE HEIR'S MANSION

17:58.880 --> 18:00.840
The blood insect is ready.

18:00.920 --> 18:04.520
After the blood transfusion,
the Princess Heir will wake up.

19:20.120 --> 19:21.800
Mei Lin, you are awake.

19:24.480 --> 19:25.960
Are you feeling any discomfort?

19:30.520 --> 19:31.880
Your Highness.

19:34.400 --> 19:35.640
You went into a coma due to the poison.

19:37.440 --> 19:38.360
Fortunately…

19:44.480 --> 19:46.720
Fortunately, the Snow Dragon Whisker
bloomed.

19:49.480 --> 19:50.640
The poison in you is neutralized.

19:52.160 --> 19:53.160
I remember

19:54.520 --> 19:55.720
when the poison acted up,

19:57.520 --> 19:59.360
my internal organs

19:59.960 --> 20:02.080
seemed to be burnt by fire.

20:06.040 --> 20:07.440
The poison in me

20:08.720 --> 20:09.560
has been neutralized?

20:18.440 --> 20:19.560
I survived?

20:22.840 --> 20:23.960
It's all in the past.

20:26.640 --> 20:27.680
Come on.

20:34.440 --> 20:38.120
Thanks to you that I survived.

20:41.800 --> 20:44.280
Thank you for saving my life.

20:46.160 --> 20:47.120
Mei Lin,

20:49.640 --> 20:50.680
you are free now.

20:56.240 --> 20:58.840
DEED OF DIVORCE

21:09.880 --> 21:13.280
When you recover,
I'll send you back to Qingzhou.

21:14.160 --> 21:16.560
Just rest well.

21:25.880 --> 21:26.720
Your Highness,

21:27.800 --> 21:28.880
what's the matter?

21:29.560 --> 21:30.560
Are you injured?

21:33.800 --> 21:37.000
A minor injury from a few days ago,
but nothing serious.

21:38.040 --> 21:41.160
It's a pity about the Qingzhou Knot.

21:41.800 --> 21:43.040
Once stained with blood,

21:44.200 --> 21:46.200
it can't be cleaned.

21:47.200 --> 21:50.480
I'll make a new one and give it to you.

21:51.440 --> 21:52.720
Okay.

22:01.160 --> 22:02.600
Have a good rest.

22:36.680 --> 22:38.800
Let us out!

22:39.560 --> 22:45.520
Let us out!

22:46.440 --> 22:49.320
The blood is not compatible.
Take her away.

22:49.400 --> 22:50.880
Let us out!

22:50.960 --> 22:52.240
- Next one.
- Let us out!

22:53.080 --> 22:53.920
Mei Lin,

22:55.680 --> 22:57.440
if you knew the truth,

22:59.360 --> 23:01.040
you wouldn't forgive me,

23:02.280 --> 23:03.560
would you?

23:21.400 --> 23:22.760
Found it.

23:43.480 --> 23:44.480
Your Highness,

23:45.520 --> 23:46.920
even if I can't help you,

23:47.880 --> 23:49.840
I hope you can be happy.

23:53.520 --> 23:55.920
The Blood Slave technique
can't cure the Momai poison?

23:57.760 --> 24:00.080
Miss Mei Lin fainted
due to the poison acting up.

24:00.160 --> 24:01.760
Using a Blood Slave to exchange blood

24:01.840 --> 24:03.640
only extends her life by three months.

24:04.960 --> 24:08.480
Only the Snow Dragon Whisker
can fully eradicate the poison.

24:09.600 --> 24:11.880
- Snow Dragon Whisker.
- Yes.

24:12.760 --> 24:14.080
I'll find another Snow Dragon Whisker.

24:14.160 --> 24:15.240
I can save Mei Lin.

24:16.360 --> 24:18.120
She only has three months left.

24:18.200 --> 24:21.920
After that,
even the Snow Dragon Whisker won't help.

24:28.080 --> 24:29.480
I'll take my leave.

24:36.440 --> 24:37.280
Your Highness.

24:38.640 --> 24:39.480
Let's go.

24:44.280 --> 24:47.040
Hasn't the poison in me been neutralized?

24:47.120 --> 24:48.800
What's with the Blood Slave technique?

25:52.720 --> 25:55.280
Yi. Yi.

26:07.440 --> 26:08.280
Yi.

26:10.200 --> 26:11.040
Yi.

26:12.320 --> 26:14.880
Yi, what happened?

26:18.520 --> 26:19.680
Yi.

26:25.400 --> 26:27.000
Using a Blood Slave to exchange blood

26:27.080 --> 26:28.920
only extends her life by three months.

26:42.640 --> 26:44.120
Are you okay, Yi?

26:44.960 --> 26:46.040
Hold on.

26:53.360 --> 26:54.520
Mei Lin,

26:58.520 --> 26:59.480
it was my fault.

27:00.200 --> 27:02.000
I failed to protect
the Snow Dragon Whisker.

27:04.040 --> 27:07.200
If my blood can save you,
I won't hurt others.

27:42.640 --> 27:43.480
Yi.

28:14.160 --> 28:18.080
Don't hurt Yi.

28:45.000 --> 28:46.080
I'm sorry.

28:49.600 --> 28:50.680
Great!

28:50.760 --> 28:52.440
The poison in Miss Mei Lin
has been neutralized.

28:52.520 --> 28:53.880
You can be relieved now.

28:56.320 --> 28:58.440
But I still feel uneasy.

28:59.440 --> 29:01.560
The visiting card from Xiyan
has arrived. Let's go immediately.

29:02.160 --> 29:03.000
My lord,

29:03.840 --> 29:05.040
since the poison has been neutralized,

29:05.120 --> 29:06.200
you should let it go.

29:07.720 --> 29:08.560
My lord.

29:10.920 --> 29:12.640
LIKE THE CONSTANT SUN

29:19.520 --> 29:20.360
Yi.

29:23.760 --> 29:24.840
Yi.

29:28.760 --> 29:29.960
Yi.

29:36.440 --> 29:37.880
- Yi.
- She is still alive.

30:21.240 --> 30:22.840
The silver needle was coated

30:24.280 --> 30:25.600
with Muscle-Paralyzing Poison.

30:28.640 --> 30:31.720
Disabling your martial arts
is to save you.

30:35.920 --> 30:37.240
Why?

30:40.560 --> 30:41.560
Yue Qin,

30:46.000 --> 30:47.840
how can you become like this?

30:49.840 --> 30:51.200
Yi's life is not in danger.

30:53.160 --> 30:54.080
Don't worry.

30:54.880 --> 30:56.160
She is very important to you.

30:56.920 --> 30:58.480
I won't let her die.

30:58.560 --> 31:00.360
Is she important

31:02.280 --> 31:04.440
because she is my friend

31:06.440 --> 31:09.480
or because you still need her blood
to detoxify me?

31:21.600 --> 31:22.760
I'm asking you.

31:26.560 --> 31:27.920
Answer me.

31:44.160 --> 31:45.680
If I don't die,

31:47.200 --> 31:49.240
you won't spare her,

31:51.000 --> 31:51.960
right?

31:52.040 --> 31:53.280
Right?

31:53.360 --> 31:54.280
You won't die.

31:54.360 --> 31:56.240
No one should die for me.

31:58.080 --> 31:59.440
The Snow Dragon Whisker is lost.

32:01.720 --> 32:02.720
That's my fate.

32:06.360 --> 32:07.720
Even ants cling to life.

32:08.680 --> 32:10.440
Why don't you want to live?

32:12.240 --> 32:13.680
Mei Lin, I beg you.

32:15.520 --> 32:17.920
Can you live as if nothing ever happened?

32:18.000 --> 32:19.280
Yue Qin,

32:21.880 --> 32:24.440
don't keep making mistakes.

32:29.280 --> 32:30.600
Once it is stained by blood,

32:31.200 --> 32:32.560
it's hard to be fully cleaned.

32:33.320 --> 32:34.840
But I don't care.

32:34.920 --> 32:36.360
I just want to protect you.

32:36.440 --> 32:37.760
I don't need it.

32:40.160 --> 32:41.560
I don't need it.

32:50.360 --> 32:52.080
I'll let you go back to Qingzhou.

32:54.920 --> 32:56.960
Everything will return to normal.

33:02.240 --> 33:03.120
Rest early.

33:03.720 --> 33:04.600
Yue Qin.

33:07.040 --> 33:08.440
Yue Qin.

33:15.800 --> 33:17.640
Take care of the Princess Heir.

33:17.720 --> 33:20.600
Without my permission,
she can't leave the room.

33:21.200 --> 33:22.040
- Yes.
- Yes.

33:25.360 --> 33:32.320
LIKE THE CONSTANT SUN

33:38.680 --> 33:39.520
Come on.

33:52.680 --> 33:53.800
I'm sorry.

33:59.640 --> 34:01.040
It's my fault.

34:03.840 --> 34:04.960
It's okay.

34:07.600 --> 34:08.600
Drink some more.

34:22.600 --> 34:23.679
It's okay.

34:23.760 --> 34:25.960
Don't be afraid. I'm here.

34:27.639 --> 34:28.480
Don't be afraid.

34:29.960 --> 34:30.800
Don't be afraid.

34:31.840 --> 34:34.560
You are wounded. Yi has gotten up.

34:34.639 --> 34:36.320
You can relax now.

34:39.239 --> 34:40.520
Jia is here to see you.

34:47.719 --> 34:49.639
If you don't eat or drink,

34:51.400 --> 34:52.560
I'll have to keep

34:53.840 --> 34:55.880
Jia here to care for you.

35:05.840 --> 35:07.160
I'll wait at the door.

35:23.560 --> 35:25.360
Don't be afraid. Don't be afraid.

35:25.440 --> 35:26.720
Everything's fine.

35:37.520 --> 35:38.520
Mei.

35:40.280 --> 35:41.320
Jia.

35:41.400 --> 35:42.560
Mei,

35:42.640 --> 35:45.120
it's been hard to see you
since you became the Princess Heir.

35:46.120 --> 35:47.360
I wasn't considerate enough.

35:47.440 --> 35:48.960
From now on,
you can visit her at any time.

35:49.040 --> 35:50.560
Great.

35:50.640 --> 35:51.800
Mei, let's go.

35:52.400 --> 35:54.880
Mei, you've lost so much weight.

35:54.960 --> 35:56.960
And you look very pale.

35:57.040 --> 35:58.680
Is the Prince Heir treating you badly?

36:00.040 --> 36:00.880
Yes.

36:02.680 --> 36:04.280
His Highness…

36:05.480 --> 36:06.760
He treats me well.

36:07.280 --> 36:10.120
Yi and I are Mei's family.

36:10.200 --> 36:12.080
You can't bully Mei.

36:12.160 --> 36:13.200
He didn't.

36:14.360 --> 36:15.680
Where is Yi?

36:18.120 --> 36:19.800
Yi is recovering.

36:20.440 --> 36:23.760
I caught a cold and passed it to her.

36:24.400 --> 36:25.760
Yi's body is weak.

36:25.840 --> 36:27.800
I've always told her
to take care of herself.

36:29.560 --> 36:32.440
Sit down. Jia has brought
Qingzhou food for you.

36:34.520 --> 36:35.680
Mei, sit down.

36:38.240 --> 36:40.840
You said you missed the taste of Qingzhou.

36:40.920 --> 36:42.120
So, I've brought you
a lot of delicious food.

36:42.200 --> 36:43.080
Try them.

36:50.480 --> 36:53.680
Jia, take this medicine pouch.

36:55.920 --> 36:57.160
Hurry up.

36:57.240 --> 36:59.320
In case I pass the sickness to you.

36:59.400 --> 37:00.960
Is it that serious?

37:01.560 --> 37:04.400
The imperial physician said
I'm still contagious,

37:04.480 --> 37:06.040
especially at this stage.

37:06.120 --> 37:07.080
Take it.

37:08.200 --> 37:10.640
I'm not worried.
I'm much stronger than Yi.

37:10.720 --> 37:12.200
You are the shopkeeper.

37:12.800 --> 37:14.960
If you get sick, it will hurt business.

37:15.040 --> 37:17.000
Take it. Leave the palace now.

37:18.640 --> 37:19.840
Leave the palace?

37:24.640 --> 37:25.680
I won't disturb you anymore.

37:29.680 --> 37:31.400
By the way, Mei, eat more.

37:32.240 --> 37:36.080
Jia, remember to open the pouch
at the station

37:36.160 --> 37:38.880
and take the medicine to avoid infection.

37:41.000 --> 37:44.040
Mei, if you suffer any grievances,
write to me.

37:44.120 --> 37:46.040
I will. Hurry and go.

37:47.680 --> 37:49.800
Your Highness, I'm leaving.

38:14.200 --> 38:15.200
Your Highness.

38:28.360 --> 38:32.000
PRINCE HEIR'S MANSION

38:35.200 --> 38:37.880
Mei, I'm scared.

38:42.120 --> 38:43.480
Only if I die

38:45.280 --> 38:46.800
can they live.

38:58.360 --> 39:00.800
Your Highness. Please come in.

39:03.560 --> 39:06.000
Mei Lin told me she took the wrong pouch

39:06.080 --> 39:07.240
and was worried you'd get sick,

39:07.320 --> 39:08.240
so she asked me to retrieve it.

39:08.320 --> 39:09.960
How careless of her.

39:22.400 --> 39:23.520
I would rather die

39:24.520 --> 39:26.800
than let you hurt anyone else.

39:29.040 --> 39:31.560
NOT TOO LATE

39:31.640 --> 39:34.440
Your Majesty,
the Princess Heir has hanged herself.

39:42.680 --> 39:44.280
Your Majesty, she is dead.

39:44.960 --> 39:49.040
How dare that Great Yan woman
die in our Xiyan?

39:49.560 --> 39:50.800
Please, Your Majesty!

39:50.880 --> 39:52.320
The Princess Heir took her own life.

39:52.400 --> 39:53.720
If Your Majesty strikes her body,

39:53.800 --> 39:55.360
it might cause diplomatic issues
with Great Yan.

39:56.520 --> 39:57.600
Who are you?

40:00.120 --> 40:01.760
A servant from the Prince Heir's Mansion.

40:08.480 --> 40:11.040
Your Majesty, since the Princess Heir
took her own life,

40:11.640 --> 40:13.440
we should suppress
the news of their divorce

40:13.520 --> 40:15.680
and report her death to Great Yan

40:15.760 --> 40:17.080
as a personal matter
between her and the Prince Heir.

40:17.680 --> 40:19.360
It will be seen as a matter
of personal relationships

40:19.440 --> 40:22.400
rather than state affairs,
minimizing the impact

40:22.480 --> 40:25.280
and avoiding delaying the construction
of Your Majesty's Tower of Immortality.

40:28.520 --> 40:30.640
You are quite smart.

40:30.720 --> 40:31.960
I am devoted to serving Your Majesty.

40:32.040 --> 40:34.040
Only with your good health

40:34.120 --> 40:35.800
can Xiyan prosper for generations to come.

40:35.880 --> 40:37.000
Alright.

40:38.200 --> 40:41.560
You will handle the funeral
of this Great Yan woman.

40:42.400 --> 40:45.760
Make sure her body is returned
to Great Yan for burial quickly,

40:45.840 --> 40:48.680
so it doesn't taint my Longevity grounds.

40:48.760 --> 40:50.080
Farewell, Your Majesty.

40:59.840 --> 41:00.680
Mei.

41:02.840 --> 41:03.680
Mei.

41:04.760 --> 41:05.600
Mei.

41:06.800 --> 41:07.640
Mei Lin.

41:08.280 --> 41:09.360
Where is Mei Lin?

41:09.960 --> 41:12.800
- What do you want to do?
- Your Majesty.

41:13.320 --> 41:16.080
You've already divorced
the Great Yan woman.

41:16.160 --> 41:17.920
Don't cause more trouble.

41:23.240 --> 41:24.600
Your Highness.

41:25.440 --> 41:27.320
If Father insists on stopping me,

41:27.400 --> 41:28.840
I will only show my resolve through death.

41:31.480 --> 41:32.560
Your Highness,

41:32.640 --> 41:35.000
I can't watch you kill yourself.

41:38.800 --> 41:41.200
Life and death are beyond your control.

41:41.280 --> 41:44.720
Sun Kunlun's life belongs to me alone.

41:46.560 --> 41:48.040
Don't you miss her?

41:49.840 --> 41:53.280
I'll reward you with confinement.

41:53.360 --> 41:54.640
Tie him up.

41:54.720 --> 41:55.760
- Yes.
- Yes.
